My name is James Francis and I handle the public records requests for the O=
regon Employment Department (OED). I wanted to acknowledge your request and=
 let you know that we've assigned it #1885. In order to fulfill your reques=
t, OED's IT department will need to search through all staff emails, and th=
is requires various levels of approval. Despite that, I hope to have more i=
nformation about what records we have and any potential fees to you by the =
end of next week (11/6/2026).

Thank you for your patience while we investigate your request. In the meant=
ime, please feel free to reach out to me with any questions.


James P. Francis (pronouns: he/him)  | Information Management Analyst

